# Source Control

Read `docs/source-control.md` and `AGENTS.md` before editing.

- The panel is a float on the NvimTree window. Never `split` under the tree.
- Do not open `vim.ui.input` on mouse click. Stage/unstage on file clicks only. `i` edits the message.
- Generate (`✦`) must use Copilot Chat **headless**. Close chat windows; time out "Generating…".
- Keep filetype `SourceControl` and window_picker disabled in `init.lua`.
